        "Algorithmic Mechanics: Two passes over the array simulate circular wrap-around without duplicating memory. Loop `i in range(2 * n)`: pop indices with `nums[idx] < nums[i % n]` setting `ans[idx] = nums[i % n]`; push `i` if `i < n`.",
