        "Define `dfs(node)` returning `(take, skip)`.",
        "For `None`, return `(0, 0)`.",
        "Otherwise `take = node.val + left_skip + right_skip` and `skip = max(left) + max(right)`.",
        "Return `max(dfs(head))`."
